​​​​​​Micro-Needling

Micro-needling is a remarkable method of improving the appearance of acne scars, hyperpigmentation, and stretch marks as well as fine lines and wrinkles. By creating tiny channels, the micro-needling process stimulates your skin to repair itself, creating new collagen without any scar formation. Because of the variable needle depth, micro-needling can be used on many parts of the body including face, neck, decolletage, arms, hands, legs, abdomen and back.


PRP Stem-Cell  Facial

Using the miracle of your own cells to rejuvenate your skin and collagen, we painlessly draw a small sample of blood; that is placed in a special centrifuge which prepares the blood serum. The miraculous cells that contain growth factors call stem cells to stimulate the creation of new skin cells and the regeneration of damaged cells that are applied to your skin using our micro-needling technique. These growth factors initiate accelerated tissue repair, angiogenesis (capillary formation), and collagen production. PRP is safe and effective on all skin types and colors. Unlike many prescription injectables, there is little to no risk of allergic reaction with PRP stem-cell injections because it requires your own blood. 


